        IF NOT (`the accused's answer` EQUALS `s 536(2) elects` `s 536(2) trial by a judge without a jury`) THEN NOTHING   -- GRANT-GATE: if -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "if the accused elects to be tried by a judge without a jury"
