GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 559(1) the judge is a court of record for all purposes of the trial and proceedings connected with it` MEANS
    IF `the judge holds a trial under this Part`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A judge who holds a trial under this Part"

-- 559 (2) The record of a trial that a judge holds under this Part shall be kept in the court over which the judge presides.
