      `the accused requests a preliminary inquiry under subsection 536.1(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the accused is able to make such a request under that subsection` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a preliminary inquiry was held` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the judge by whom the accused is tried has allowed an amendment to the information` IS A BOOLEAN
