    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the accused re-elects under section 561.1 to be tried by a judge without a jury` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If an accused re-elects under section 561.1 to be tried by a judge without a jury"
