        IF NOT `the election, re-election or deemed election is for trial by a provincial court judge or a judge without a jury` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for trial by a provincial court judge or a judge without a jury"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

